Subject: [PATCH] Wild Pokemon on Johto's main path a little under the next
 boss

The grass and caves on the way to each Johto boss kept HeartGold's own
low levels (Routes 30-31 at Lv. 2-5 before Falkner's 12, Routes 42-43 at
14-19 before Pryce's 40), which under the scaled experience formula give
a team at the bosses' levels little. Each area on the main path is tied
to the boss after it, and its walking levels move into a band under that
boss's average: 55-80% before Falkner, 75-85% after. Surfing, fishing,
Rock Smash, Routes 29 and 46 and the optional higher areas are unchanged.
Generated by tools/hack/johto_wild.py.
